+## Review findings
+
+Holes found 2026-10-14 against current MicroPython `master` (`.mpy` 6.3:
+`py/bc.h`, `py/bc0.h`, `py/persistentcode.h`, `py/obj.h`,
+`mpy-cross/mpconfigport.h`, `ports/unix`) and against pycore `371dc007`.
